			"text":"milestones.\n\n1. Player can shoot en kogels weerkaatsen van objecten. (physics engine)\n2. Player movement.\n3. Enemy detection. (state machine)\n4. Enemy + Player health.\n5. Player en geweer animatie.\n6. Enemy animatie.\n",
